            "id": "4951648",
            "title": "PepsiCo, Delta Lead Upcoming Earnings Slate; Fed Minutes In Focus",
            "description": "<html><body><p data-eci=\"true\"><span data-path-to-node=\"1,0\">Get ahead of the market by subscribing to Seeking Alpha's Wall Street Week Ahead, a preview of key events scheduled for the coming week.</span><span data-path-to-node=\"1,1\"></span><span data-path-to-node=\"1,2\"> The newsletter keeps you informed of the biggest stories set to make headlines, including upcoming IPOs, investor days, earnings reports, and conference presentations.</span></p> <p data-path-to-node=\"1\" id=\"p-rc_6330d4e48646cb61-31\"> </p> <p data-path-to-node=\"2\" id=\"p-rc_6330d4e48646cb61-32\"><span data-path-to-node=\"2,0\">U.S. equities climbed Friday after the September nonfarm payrolls report came in cooler than economists expected and further eased expectations for a Federal Reserve rate hike this month.</span><span data-path-to-node=\"2,1\"></span><span data-path-to-node=\"2,2\"> The Bureau of Labor Statistics reported that employers added just 29K jobs in September, well short of the 85K consensus figure and a sharp slowdown from August's downwardly revised gain of 133K.</span><span data-path-to-node=\"2,3\"></span></p> <p data-path-to-node=\"3\" id=\"p-rc_6330d4e48646cb61-33\"><span data-path-to-node=\"3,0\"><span class=\"citation-198 citation-end-198\">The upcoming week will start with September services PMI data on Monday, followed by an update Tuesday on the U.S. trade balance for August.</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"3,1\"></span><span data-path-to-node=\"3,2\"><span class=\"citation-197 citation-end-197\"> From there, the Federal Open Market Committee meeting minutes </span>and August consumer credit are both due out on Wednesday, and then weekly jobless claims and August wholesale inventories will be released Thursday.</span><span data-path-to-node=\"3,3\"></span><span data-path-to-node=\"3,4\"> The University of Michigan's initial consumer sentiment survey for October is set to arrive Friday.</span><span data-path-to-node=\"3,5\"></span></p> <p data-path-to-node=\"4\" id=\"p-rc_6330d4e48646cb61-34\"><span data-path-to-node=\"4,0\">Notable companies due to report in the coming week include PepsiCo (<a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/symbol/PEP\" title=\"PepsiCo, Inc.\">PEP</a>) and Delta Air Lines (<a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/symbol/DAL\" title=\"Delta Air Lines, Inc.\">DAL</a>).</span><span data-path-to-node=\"4,1\"></span></p> <p data-path-to-node=\"4\"><span data-path-to-node=\"4,0\"></span>______________________________________________________________</p> <p data-path-to-node=\"6\" id=\"p-rc_6330d4e48646cb61-35\"><span data-path-to-node=\"6,0\">Earnings spotlight: Tuesday: Constellation Brands (<a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/symbol/STZ\" title=\"Constellation Brands, Inc.\">STZ</a>). <a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/earnings/earnings-calendar#hasComeFromMpArticle=false\">See the full earnings calendar.</a></span><span data-path-to-node=\"6,1\"></span></p> <p data-path-to-node=\"7\" id=\"p-rc_6330d4e48646cb61-36\"><span data-path-to-node=\"7,0\">Earnings spotlight: Wednesday: Levi Strauss (<a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/symbol/LEVI\" title=\"Levi Strauss &amp; Co.\">LEVI</a>). <a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/earnings/earnings-calendar#hasComeFromMpArticle=false\">See the full earnings calendar.</a></span><span data-path-to-node=\"7,1\"></span></p> <p data-path-to-node=\"8\" id=\"p-rc_6330d4e48646cb61-37\"><span data-path-to-node=\"8,0\">Earnings spotlight: Thursday: PepsiCo. <a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/earnings/earnings-calendar#hasComeFromMpArticle=false\">See the full earnings calendar.</a></span><span data-path-to-node=\"8,1\"></span></p> <p data-path-to-node=\"9\" id=\"p-rc_6330d4e48646cb61-38\"><span data-path-to-node=\"9,0\">Earnings spotlight: Friday: Delta Air Lines. <a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/earnings/earnings-calendar#hasComeFromMpArticle=false\">See the full earnings calendar.</a></span><span data-path-to-node=\"9,1\"></span></p> <p data-path-to-node=\"10\" id=\"p-rc_6330d4e48646cb61-39\"><span data-path-to-node=\"10,0\"><b data-index-in-node=\"0\" data-path-to-node=\"10,0\">Volatility watch</b> - Astera Labs (<a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/symbol/ALAB\" title=\"Astera Labs, Inc.\">ALAB</a>) and Lumentum (<a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/symbol/LITE\" title=\"Lumentum Holdings Inc.\">LITE</a>) have seen options volatility increase over the last week.</span><span data-path-to-node=\"10,1\"></span><span data-path-to-node=\"10,2\"> The most overbought stocks per their 14-day Relative Strength Index include Armada Acquisition Corp. II (<a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/symbol/AACI\" title=\"Armada Acquisition Corp. III\">AACI</a>), Kodiak Sciences (<a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/symbol/KOD\" title=\"Kodiak Sciences Inc.\">KOD</a>), and Pacific Bio (<a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/symbol/PACB\" title=\"Pacific Biosciences of California, Inc.\">PACB</a>).</span><span data-path-to-node=\"10,3\"></span><span data-path-to-node=\"10,4\"> The most oversold stocks per their 14-day Relative Strength Index include Advasa Holdings (<a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/symbol/ADBT\" title=\"Advasa Holdings Inc.\">ADBT</a>) and MGM Resorts (<a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/symbol/MGM\" title=\"MGM Resorts International\">MGM</a>).</span><span data-path-to-node=\"10,5\"></span><span data-path-to-node=\"10,6\"> Short</span></p></body></html>",
